Package: @@PACKAGE@@
Version: @@VERSION@@
Architecture: @@ARCH@@
Maintainer: @@VENDOR@@ <maintainers@astraos.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://astraos.invalid
Depends: bash (>= 5.0), coreutils, grep, sed, gawk, procps, util-linux, iproute2, kmod, dpkg
Recommends: pciutils, usbutils, lm-sensors
Description: AstraOS base system identity, policy and diagnostics
 Provides the parts of AstraOS that are not branding or desktop: the distribution
 identity file, the sysctl hardening defaults, the sudo policy, the APT signature
 policy, the documented firewall policy, the astraos-info diagnostic command, and
 astraos-scan-secrets, the credential scan that the image build runs before packing.
 .
 This is an independent distribution based on Debian GNU/Linux. It is not an
 official Debian release. /etc/os-release, /etc/issue and /etc/motd are written at
 image build time because base-files owns those paths as configuration files; see
 docs/KNOWN_LIMITATIONS.md.
